    "https://www.instagram.com/api/v1/direct_v2/create_group_thread/"
)
SESSION_VERSION = 1
SENSITIVE_HEADERS = {"cookie", "x-csrftoken"}
REMOVED_HEADERS = {"content-length", "accept-encoding"}
DATA_FLAGS = {"--data", "--data-raw", "--data-binary", "-d"}

HELP = """instagram — agent-first CLI over an authenticated Instagram web session.

This capability drives the same private browser-session endpoints used by
instagram.com. It is stateful and may stop working when Instagram changes its
web client. Run `instagram doctor` before domain work. Checkpoints, challenges,
CAPTCHA, and 2FA always require the user in the browser; this tool never bypasses
them.

Connections
  An explicit connections registry is required, even for one account. Put it in
  the consuming project's Instagram envelope or in
