  successful IGDirectTextSendMutation in Network, and choose Copy as cURL. Keep
  the capture out of chat and import it locally:

    instagram refresh --clipboard [--connection ID]
    instagram refresh /protected/path/request.curl [--connection ID]
    instagram refresh - [--connection ID]        # read cURL from stdin

  Refresh only mints local session state. Run doctor immediately afterwards.

